WB5E / BK7258 — ST77916 1.8-inch round QSPI display

360x360 RGB565, four data lines, 80 MHz QSPI, LVGL 9 HyperX dashboard.
Validated rendering and completed transfers: 72–79 fps.

Documentation and build instructions: doc/README.md
Display recovery report: doc/display-recovery-20261108/恢复与帧率验证.md

The upstream SDK, toolchains, local Wi-Fi credentials, and private firmware
are intentionally excluded. See doc/README.md to prepare the SDK and build.
